// Linnet Hatch body: a 2001 five-door compact hatchback.
//
// Intent: short, tall and all glass. A stubby rounded nose with big swept lamps and a
// thin grille, a steep windshield running almost straight on from the hood, a high roof
// held level to the back, big side glass with a little window in the rear pillar, an
// upright hatch with tall lamps up its sides. Body-colored bumpers, black trim, steel
// wheels under covers. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
